Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-Second Episode\NThe Silver Ship
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.10,0:01:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.26,0:01:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverland, whose name\Nmeans "the land of silver."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...\NMany centuries ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.46,0:02:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Silverland was\Nso rich in silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.46,0:02:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...that many armies\Nfought to conquer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.38,0:02:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The King, who wanted to keep\Nall the silver for himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.50,0:02:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,waged many wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.46,0:02:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result,\Nthe country was always in turmoil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.78,0:02:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...and the people suffered greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.18,0:02:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But suddenly\Na knight appeared...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,in all-silver armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.42,0:02:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He robbed the King\Nof all his silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.06,0:02:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...and with it he made\Na silver ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.78,0:02:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,which then sank in a swamp
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The mystery of the ship\Nis written in this sentence:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.42,0:02:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"The silver swamp sleeps quietly\Nunder three half-moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.26,0:02:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,From the circles of water\Nrises a silver ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...and a silver knight\Nshouts to the sky:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.22,0:02:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,'The moon! The moon can help me!\NThe moon can give me strength!'"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And time passed\Nand the legend was forgotten
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.82,0:03:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder when that damn guy\Nwill stop reading standing up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,anything else\Ninteresting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.66,0:03:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you\Ndust my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.26,0:03:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been there so long\Nthat I mistook you for a book!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.30,0:03:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.46,0:03:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see anymore! I can't see anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.86,0:03:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So you want war?!\NFine, you'll have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.50,0:03:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this! And this! And this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Maybe it would be\Nbest to rest for a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.74,0:04:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest, you said?\NAlright, I agree! Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.38,0:04:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"The silver marsh sleeps quietly\Nunder three crescent moons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.50,0:04:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,From the ripples of water\Nrises a silver ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...and a silver knight\Ncries out to the sky:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,'The moon! The moon can help me!\NThe moon can give me strength!'"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.66,0:04:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This must be the key...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.70,0:04:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...to find\Nthat legendary silver ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Which legendary\Nsilver ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That ship that no one yet knows\Nwhere it ended up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.58,0:04:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly! And the words\Nwritten in this book...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,..could show us the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So, did you manage\Nto find out where it could be?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:05:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not exactly
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,With the words from that book\Nit shouldn't be difficult...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,to find the silver ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.26,0:05:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.54,0:05:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that silver ship\Nreally so precious then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.94,0:05:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! And we must prevent any\Nevil person from taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.50,0:05:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And it worries me that\NDuralumin is also aware of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.74,0:05:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- I've had an idea!\N- Let's hope it's a good idea
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's a great idea! The two of us\Nwill set out in search of the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If we find it again,\Nwe’ll divide the treasure...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.62,0:05:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...among all the inhabitants\Nof the town! Isn't it great?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonderful! If we divide\Nthe treasure among all the people,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone will be rich\Nand Duralumin won't be able to use it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.06,0:05:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...to perform evil deeds!\NIt's truly an excellent idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well done!\N- Let's look for the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.22,0:05:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Three half-moons, three half-moons...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- The silver ship...\N- Three half-moons...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.06,0:06:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you perhaps found something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet, but I must have it\Nat any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a great treasure, you know, Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.02,0:06:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I know!\NAnd I'd want it all for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.42,0:06:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You will find the treasure and sell it\Nto some other country.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,With the proceeds, you'll be able to\Nhire a great army.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.82,0:06:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, if we find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got him! I've got him on the hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.70,0:06:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Fish, have you ever seen a\Nsilver ship in this pond?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, a big ship, all made\Nof silver! Tell me, have you ever seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No? Thanks anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.38,0:06:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get caught again, okay? Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the only fish I had caught\Nall day!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.42,0:06:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Water bird, is there by any chance a\Nsilver ship at the bottom of the lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.06,0:07:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s not here! It’s not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.58,0:07:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Three half-moons, three half-moons..
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Three half-moons...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.66,0:07:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A silver ship in a silver swamp:\Nbut it’s absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.50,0:07:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, there is only one moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you solved the riddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.30,0:07:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you Nylon, I asked\Nyou if you solved the riddle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.90,0:07:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Answer!\N- Greetings, Grand Duke Duralumin
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hello, hello... - You were playing,\Ninstead of obeying me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.06,0:07:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But I’ll cut your nose off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.34,0:07:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! Not the nose! I swear to you,\NI wasn't playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Have you solved the enigma?\N- Actually, not yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.26,0:07:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean "not yet"?!\NYou lazybones!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to solve\Nthe riddle of the three half-moons,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.66,0:07:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally I’ve got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"Half-moon" means an arch.\NThree half-moons: three arches!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.94,0:08:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Look closely\Nat those three half-moons over there
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They must mean arches or mountains\Nin the middle of the Northern woods!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.26,0:08:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe the silver ship\Nis right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The three crescents are actually\Nthe peaks of those three mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But there’s no marsh here!\NWhere is the silver marsh? Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! But it's full of water here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.62,0:08:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.26,0:08:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just an illusion!\NBut maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.50,0:08:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...there was a marsh here\Nin the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.02,0:09:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought: once,\Nthere was water here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.86,0:09:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I’d really like to know what it\Nwas I had climbed onto before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.38,0:09:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver! It's silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.38,0:09:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.46,0:09:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally I found it! The silver ship\Nmust be buried here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.70,0:09:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And this must be\Na part of the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, it's the mast!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's dig! Dig! Dig! Dig!\NCome on, dig!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.62,0:09:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a shovel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A shovel! A shovel! A shovel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.42,0:10:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Moon, answer me:\Nhow long was I sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who woke me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.62,0:10:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, moon, please!\NAnd tell me:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,does evil still threaten the Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, give me strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.90,0:11:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, owl...\NCould you tell me, please,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...if you have ever heard of\Na silver ship...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.66,0:11:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...at the bottom of a silver swamp?\NNo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.78,0:11:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Tink. Goodnight
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get discouraged, Sapphire.\NWe will go look for it again tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.18,0:11:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bye!\N- Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already night, I have to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.54,0:11:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are three crescents over there!\NStop, Opal! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.18,0:12:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the Rainbow Mountains! I\Nunderstand! Hurry, Opal! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The three crescents\Nare the peaks of those mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.50,0:12:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but the swamp isn't here.\NAccording to the words of that book,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.26,0:12:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,there should have been\Na silver swamp here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Why have you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Sapphire,\Nthe Prince of this Country!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.78,0:12:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come to search\Nfor the swamp of legend!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you are a descendant\Nof that cursed, foolish King.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.94,0:12:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it you who woke me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.94,0:12:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,So that silver swamp\Nwas right here...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.62,0:12:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.74,0:13:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.90,0:13:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm finished..!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.66,0:13:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Luna! Luna, help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, give me strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.70,0:13:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now or never!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What could have happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.62,0:14:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's disappeared! But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.74,0:14:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Knight! Knight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.62,0:14:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are vampire bats!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I must escape while this torch is burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a door!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They're coming! I have to flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.82,0:14:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to manage to open it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Down! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.62,0:15:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up or the sun will rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.94,0:15:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Damn it, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.14,0:15:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, did it really weigh a hundred tons?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure! Judging\Nby the height of the mast...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.82,0:15:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This winch, maybe,\Nwon't be enough to pull it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.46,0:16:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.50,0:16:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, how big it is!\NEven the oars are silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.22,0:16:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to share it\Nwith all the people of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.14,0:16:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't touch the ship!\N- It's him! What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not hand over this ship to you, because\Nthe blood of that foolish King...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.34,0:16:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,..flows in your veins!\N- But who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.90,0:16:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been protecting this ship\Nfor hundreds of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.54,0:16:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a silver spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.18,0:16:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon we will arrive\Nat the treasure swamp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.02,0:16:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.34,0:16:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.30,0:16:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to share this treasure\Nwith all the people of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.90,0:16:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your ancestor said the same thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.46,0:16:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but then he kept everything for himself..
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.58,0:16:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,..and because of him\Nmany wars were fought
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.42,0:16:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...and thousands of lives\Nwere destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.10,0:16:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I stole\Nthe King's silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.38,0:16:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now my spirit\Ndwells in this armor
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.14,0:17:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,..to protect this ship
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.22,0:17:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be fooled\Nby your words!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to deceive you! For myself\NI want neither the silver, nor the jewels!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.46,0:17:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I only want to share them with the poor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.62,0:17:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you to believe me,\NI swear to you that is what I'll do!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver spirit,\Nlisten to me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.18,0:17:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want the gold, the silver\Nor the jewels!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I only want to divide them\Namong the poor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.30,0:17:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver spirit,\Nare you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.30,0:17:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver spirit!\NSilver spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.66,0:17:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where could he have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.90,0:17:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But your body isn't...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.90,0:17:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Only my spirit\Ndwells in this armor,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:18:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,to prevent anyone from throwing\Nthe world into chaos with this silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.02,0:18:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You helped me.\NWhy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.66,0:18:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Silver spirit!\N- Prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.90,0:18:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- You've come to your senses.\N- I have to ask you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Some foolish men have come\Nto take the silver ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.62,0:19:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- Lower the crane!\N- Lower the crane!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot move\Nwithout the moonlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.14,0:19:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wear this armor in my place\Nand protect the silver ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.14,0:19:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This armor is lighter than a\Nfeather and stronger than iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.26,0:19:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- It will protect you.\N- Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.30,0:19:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems we have hooked\Nthe ship, Nylon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.90,0:19:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course! Hoist the crane!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.54,0:19:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hoist the crane!\N- Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.70,0:19:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is, it's coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.54,0:20:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the silver ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.74,0:20:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't waste time!\NHurry up and pull it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I thought! You're\Nquite a bunch of thugs, you lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.58,0:20:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.58,0:20:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the silver knight,\Nthe guardian of this ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.86,0:20:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and I will not surrender it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill that monster immediately\Nwith arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.14,0:20:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I’m coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:21:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s useless! You cannot penetrate\Nmy armor with bows or arrows!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.54,0:21:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- He’s a monster! Let’s flee!\N- Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.70,0:21:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s run away! He’s coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.70,0:21:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, behind here!\NDon’t let yourself be seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.90,0:21:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.54,0:21:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is he doing?\N- He’s fighting with the soldiers, down there
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.50,0:21:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve got it!\NLet’s release the brakes on this winch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...and we’ll crush him under it!\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hurray!\N- We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.10,0:22:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The water is coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.02,0:22:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s run! Let’s run!\NOtherwise we’ll drown!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.34,0:22:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally on dry land!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.54,0:22:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you dare\Nreturn up before me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.78,0:22:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s your fault that we didn’t manage\Nto take the silver, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.42,0:22:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and let me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.90,0:22:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, you won’t go up first!\N- Yes, I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.10,0:22:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you ugly...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.06,0:23:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, thanks to you\NI was able to protect...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.50,0:23:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...the silver ship\Nfrom those thugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.54,0:23:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- I will give it to you.\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.46,0:23:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The silver ship\Nis your treasure, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.38,0:23:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But until you are King and have\Nbrought peace to your country,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.98,0:23:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will keep it at the bottom of the lake
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.30,0:23:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I will watch you from this silver\Nswamp... until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.42,0:23:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, please! I will not fail\Nto bring peace to my country.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember: until then,\NI will watch you from this swamp!
